# Stenion dashboard configuration.(whuch nt be necessary for the dashboard itself, but is needed for the API routes it calls)

#   DATABASE_URL         — Neon pooled connection string (used by the API routes AND
#                          the server-rendered pages, which read the Store in-process)
#   STENION_RPC_URL      — Soroban RPC        (cron route only)
#   STENION_HORIZON_URL  — Horizon            (cron route only)
#   CRON_SECRET          — shared secret for POST /api/cron/run-indexer
